## Critical Anti-Patterns (Hallucination Prevention)

### ❌ DO NOT Hardcode Credentials
- Never put connection strings in code
- Never commit passwords or secrets to git
- Always use configuration management

### ❌ DO NOT Assume File Locations
- Always check `SystemIndex.md` for current structure
- Use search tools to verify file existence
- Reference files by absolute paths when possible

### ❌ DO NOT Invent API Endpoints
- Always check this file or Architecture.md for actual endpoints
- Verify endpoints before referencing in tests or code
- Use search to find actual route definitions

### ❌ DO NOT Create Random Test Data
- Use documented canonical test data
- Do not create random identifiers
- Follow established test patterns

